---
description: Prefer CPC_CACHE before network fetches
alwaysApply: true
---

Before downloading or fetching skills, files, logos, binaries, or other assets:

1. Read `CPC_CACHE` (default `C:\CPC\cache`).
2. Check the Cache directory for an existing copy.
3. Prefer the local copy when suitable.
4. Only then use network / browser / installers.

There is no `cpc-cache` MCP in v1. Soft hooks reinforce this; they never block tools.
